  contentsAnswer: Roadside mechanic. Sockets, spanners, a hammer. The truck outside
    is my next problem.
  weightAnswer: Just shy of fifteen kilos. I carry it every day.
  metalAnswer: Mostly steel. If it barely registers, then we have a problem.
  packingAnswer: The tray latch broke. It can knock against the case, but it is not
    powered.
  responseAnswer: One quick rattle, then quiet. That is the tray hitting the side.
  authorReasoning: 'Innocent: 14.8 kg and strong metal match tools; immediate short
    pulse agrees with the loose tray. Weight alone is not a threat.'
